list to be anyone who receives “influence” from&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:27.120
other countries, which like, how do you define&nbsp;
influence? However you want. This list is now just&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:27.120 --> 00:00:31.920
a list of anyone that Putin doesn't like. These&nbsp;
people now have to disclose that they are foreign&nbsp;&nbsp;

